invariant: INV-14
file: src/x25519_wide_ed25519.h
catches: dnssec_test
reason: ed25519_verify_hram accepts a key outside the subgroup of prime
  order L. Such a key is a sum A + T with T of order 2, 4 or 8, and a
  signature made with A's scalar meets the equation under it whenever the
  order of T divides h. RFC 8032 permits that key, and
  docs/decisions.md 227 refuses it. bin/dnssec_test presents seven such
  signatures (test/gen_ed25519_mixed_order_vectors.py), and fails on this
  edit.

--- old
    if (!fe_equal(acc.x, FE_ZERO) || !fe_equal(acc.y, acc.z)) {
        return 0;
    }
--- new
